<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bouygues said started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bouygues said started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities said it started coverage of Bouygues Offshore SA with a buy rating, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
</text>
